type: software
title: "False witnesses for small Shor experiments: code and data"
abstract: >-
  Generic Shor circuit generator laid out on a line of heavy-hex qubits, exact arithmetic model, false-witness
  controls, pre-registration and time-stamping tools, and the raw data of ten IBM Quantum jobs (ibm_kingston,
  27-28 October 2026) with the scripts that recompute every hardware number, figure and table of the preprint.
